<title>JAPAN: Orix shares climb to high for 1997.</title>
<headline>Orix shares climb to high for 1997.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Orix Corp rose to a high for this calendar year, helped by the firm's bright prospects ahead of Japan's &quot;Big Bang&quot; financial deregulation, traders said.</p>
<p>By 0125 GMT, the major leasing company's share price had climbed 130 yen to 6,260, a high for this year.  </p>
<p>The trading volume was 46,800 shares.</p>
<p>&quot;Since the group operates broadly in the financial sector, investors expect the firm to grow largely by surviving the 'Big Bang',&quot; said a major securities house trader.</p>
</text>
